From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] setupapi, cfgmgr32: resource descriptors

CM_Get_Next_Res_Des(_Ex), CM_Get_Res_Des_Data(_Ex), CM_Get_Res_Des_Data_Size(_Ex), CM_Free_Res_Des_Handle, CM_Free_Res_Des(_Ex), CM_Add_Res_Des(_Ex), CM_Modify_Res_Des(_Ex) and CM_Free_Log_Conf(_Ex) were spec stubs (UltiMaker Cura imports three). With no logical configuration on any device (8246) no configuration or descriptor handle exists: the calls check pointers, flags and the resource type (CR_INVALID_POINTER, CR_INVALID_FLAG, CR_INVALID_RESOURCEID) and report the handle invalid (CR_INVALID_RES_DES / CR_INVALID_LOG_CONF). cfgmgr32 forwards them; cfgmgr32.h gains RES_DES, RESOURCEID, the ResType_ values and the prototypes.
---
